Golem generation is trivial with polypiling, and charming the
resulting golem is also trivial with a scroll of taming due to their
low magic resistance. So hey, two items versus one, but you're using
up a scroll either way.

As for golems generated tame, I like that idea a lot. A pet iron golem
is damn useful in the early game.


